  <item>
    <title>VOL.003：广漂七年，竟行唔出天河？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/665b1b1e94977a26ef7b68bf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">665b1b1e94977a26ef7b68bf</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 01 Jun 2024 12:59:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>广漂七年，竟行唔出天河？！</span><br><span>係呀，就係我！</span><br><br><span>我和生活在广州十年的</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b4f71cc4eacab7f39634053?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b4f71cc4eacab7f39634053&amp;apptime=1717242806" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b4f71cc4eacab7f39634053?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b4f71cc4eacab7f39634053&amp;apptime=1717242806"><span>@Eddy</span></a><br><span>以广州第一家宜家为起点，</span><br><span>展开聊了聊天河北/林和西周边</span><br><span>那些“来了”又“走了”的商场？！</span><br><br><span>主播🎙️</span><a href="https://www.idanchaof.com/" data-url="https://www.idanchaof.com/"><span>@Roger</span></a><span> </span><br><span>嘉宾👤</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b4f71cc4eacab7f39634053?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b4f71cc4eacab7f39634053&amp;apptime=1717242806" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b4f71cc4eacab7f39634053?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b4f71cc4eacab7f39634053&amp;apptime=1717242806"><span>@Eddy</span></a><br><br><span>⏱️时间轴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 广州首家策展型商业体—「YCC！天宜」没了…</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="271">04:31</a> 从「宜家」到「天宜」，再到“宜家”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 「YCC！天宜」的年轻力竟不行？！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> 提到广州东，不得不提的「PoPrak东方宝泰」</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a> 每个一线城市都有的「ICC」？！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a> 原来，行街既尽头喺天环？！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a> 天河北还有这里可以喝☕️</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 吃是重点，逛是其次（Callback上一期😁）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2166">36:06</a> 更多收听方式👂</span><br><br><br><span>📻 </span><a href="https://talk30.podcast.xyz/" data-url="https://talk30.podcast.xyz/"><span>了解更多</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lm4YPTT82oSGntjBfeGBoZiJbu4K.m4a" length="35287505" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGkHqKS815MgJllejifBgl7xeA0.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>VOL.002：初来乍到，在广州食乜嘢？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d39bd635dd8780edf643e0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d39bd635dd8780edf643e0</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Feb 2024 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1️⃣月底趁@2ric 出差广州就喊来@船长 一起聊了这么一期。</span></p><p><span>魔都有股神奇的魔力，</span><br><span>香港到底有多“吵”，</span><br><span>麦当劳竟然被推荐？！</span></p><p><span>最最重要的是，</span><br><span>如果你是初来乍到，</span><br><span>在广州可以食乜嘢？！</span><br><br><span>主播🎙️</span><a href="https://www.idanchaof.com/" data-url="https://www.idanchaof.com/"><span>@Roger</span></a><span> </span><br><span>嘉宾👤</span><a href="https://okjk.co/JNdIxG" data-url="https://okjk.co/JNdIxG"><span>@刘北席</span></a><span> &nbsp;👤</span><a href="https://okjk.co/DGjKVe" data-url="https://okjk.co/DGjKVe"><span>@2ric</span></a><br><br><span>⏱️时间轴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> </span><a href="https://okjk.co/DGjKVe" data-url="https://okjk.co/DGjKVe"><span>@2ric</span></a><span>的出差季及对北上广深的感受</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 从当天的晚餐和上一次的晚餐</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 不能错过的炭炉鸡煲及吃不完的西华路</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 潮汕菜？茶楼？！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">19:43</a> 给经常在北京吃叉烧</span><a href="https://okjk.co/DGjKVe" data-url="https://okjk.co/DGjKVe"><span>@2ric</span></a><span> 必须推荐的店</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1229">20:29</a> 濑粉是个什么粉？！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> “胡辣汤”竟然还有高配版？！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1454">24:14</a> </span><a href="https://okjk.co/JNdIxG" data-url="https://okjk.co/JNdIxG"><span>@刘北席</span></a><span>的私家推荐榜单</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 广州的异国料理 &nbsp;</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 举起手中的凉茶，干杯</span><br><br><br><br><span>📻 </span><a href="https://talk30.podcast.xyz/" data-url="https://talk30.podcast.xyz/"><span>更多收听方式</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnJoDIy9fNZS_mqLC--jyl69gVT-.m4a" length="21083490" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:49</itunes:duration>
